,Open Graph,technical SEO\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/about\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — Evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Free single-page SEO audit. Check titles, meta descriptions, headings, canonical, robots, Open Graph, Twitter Cards, images, links and structured data — with a documented score, evidence for every finding and a downloadable report.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://localhost:3000\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?7f9fdba0b5871059\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — Evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Free single-page SEO audit. Check titles, meta descriptions, headings, canonical, robots, Open Graph, Twitter Cards, images, links and structured data — with a documented score, evidence for every finding and a downloadable report.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?7f9fdba0b5871059\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?3eb8bf4e55e452bd\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" sizes=\"any\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon?65733ec3c15c3c62\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"180x180\"/><script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem('theme');if(t==='light'||t==='dark')document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t}catch(e){}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-dvh bg-bg text-ink\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"no-print pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-1\"></div><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-2\"></div><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-3\"></div><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-4\"></div><div class=\"ambient-dots absolute inset-0\"></div></div><header class=\"site-header no-print sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-line/70 bg-bg/80 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-3.5\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5 text-ink\" aria-label=\"SEO Audit Analyzer home\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-8 w-8 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-[-6deg] group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"audit-mark\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#142c43\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#1c5269\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"url(#audit-mark)\"></rect><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8bd8e3\" stroke-opacity=\".25\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M15 39h8l6-14 8 20 6-13h6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"32\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#65d6c5\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-[17px]\">SEO Audit <span class=\"text-accent\">Analyzer</span></span></a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"ml-auto hidden items-center gap-1 text-sm sm:flex\"><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#features\">Features</a><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Switch to dark mode\" class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface text-muted transition hover:border-accent hover:text-accent active:scale-95\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"no-scrollbar flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto border-t border-line/70 px-4 py-2 sm:hidden\"><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#features\">Features</a><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a></nav></header><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-6 pt-12\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent\">Company</p><h1 class=\"mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl\">About SEO Audit Analyzer</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-muted text-pretty\">We build SEO audits you can check for yourself — every finding shows what was inspected, the evidence found and why it matters.</p><div class=\"card mt-8 space-y-4 p-6 leading-relaxed sm:p-8 [&amp;_h2]:mt-6 [&amp;_h2]:text-xl [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_a]:text-accent [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:bg-panel-2 [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_code]:text-sm\"><h2>Why we built it</h2><p>Most SEO tools hand you a single number and a long list of warnings. It is hard to tell which findings are real, which are guesses, and what the number even means. SEO Audit Analyzer is built around the opposite idea: show the work.</p><h2>What we believe</h2><ul><li><b>Evidence over opinion.</b> Each check displays the exact value it found on your page.</li><li><b>Honest scoring.</b> The score comes from a published rubric. It is not a Google ranking score and never promises rankings.</li><li><b>Clear limits.</b> Anything we did not measure — performance, JavaScript-rendered content, backlinks — is listed as not evaluated rather than guessed.</li><li><b>Safe by design.</b> Pages are fetched with strict network safeguards so the tool cannot be pointed at private systems.</li></ul><h2>What it does today</h2><p>A live single-page audit across on-page, indexing, social, content, rendering and technical signals, plus performance, broken links, a site crawl, keywords, security and traffic. Each has its own page, and the whole report downloads as PDF, HTML, Markdown, CSV or JSON. Backlink counts and search volumes need paid data and are not included.</p><p><a href=\"/\">Run an audit</a> or <a href=\"/contact\">get in touch</a>.</p></div></main><footer class=\"no-print mt-24 border-t border-line bg-surface/60\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-12 sm:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5 text-ink\" aria-label=\"SEO Audit Analyzer home\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-8 w-8 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-[-6deg] group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"audit-mark\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#142c43\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#1c5269\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"url(#audit-mark)\"></rect><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8bd8e3\" stroke-opacity=\".25\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M15 39h8l6-14 8 20 6-13h6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"32\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#65d6c5\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-[17px]\">SEO Audit <span class=\"text-accent\">Analyzer</span></span></a><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-muted\">Evidence-backed SEO audits<!-- -->. Every score comes with the evidence, the reasoning and a fix.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Product\"><h2 class=\"eyebrow\">Product</h2><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/#how-it-works\">How it works</a></li><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/#modules\">What gets checked</a></li><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/#features\">Features</a></li><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/#method\">Scoring method</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label=\"Company\"><h2 class=\"eyebrow\">Company</h2><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/about\">About us</a></li><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label=\"Legal\"><h2 class=\"eyebrow\">Legal</h2><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a class=\"text-muted transition hover:text-accent\" href=\"/terms\">Terms of use</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-5 py-5 text-xs text-muted sm:flex-row sm:justify-between\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->SEO Audit Analyzer<!-- -->. Scoring rubric 2026.3.</p><p>Audit scores are not Google ranking scores. Not affiliated with Google.</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1396ad735eba86b9.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[5668,[\\\"668\\\",\\\"static/chunks/668-7f6f4e4703d7fcca.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-8b451254ab9cfb9a.js\\\"],\\\"ReportProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[6309,[\\\"668\\\",\\\"static/chunks/668-7f6f4e4703d7fcca.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-8b451254ab9cfb9a.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[9903,[\\\"668\\\",\\\"static/chunks/668-7f6f4e4703d7fcca.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-8b451254ab9cfb9a.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[7924,[\\\"668\\\",\\\"static/chunks/668-7f6f4e4703d7fcca.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-8b451254ab9cfb9a.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[2619,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"668\\\",\\\"static/chunks/668-7f6f4e4703d7fcca.js\\\",\\\"220\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/about/page-1f3a4fa8b4ea55d6.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n11:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/d984b921b3e2a4bc.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"7QrUFpkHCu0gmrphTjyBE\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"about\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"about\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\"