und on your page.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"children\":\"Honest scoring.\"}],\" The score comes from a published rubric. It is not a Google ranking score and never promises rankings.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"children\":\"Clear limits.\"}],\" Anything we did not measure — performance, JavaScript-rendered content, backlinks — is listed as not evaluated rather than guessed.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"children\":\"Safe by design.\"}],\" Pages are fetched with strict network safeguards so the tool cannot be pointed at private systems.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"What it does today\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"A live single-page audit across on-page, indexing, social, content, rendering and technical signals, plus performance, broken links, a site crawl, keywords, security and traffic. Each has its own page, and the whole report downloads as PDF, HTML, Markdown, CSV or JSON. Backlink counts and search volumes need paid data and are not included.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"children\":\"Run an audit\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"href\":\"/contact\",\"children\":\"get in touch\"}],\".\"]}]]}]]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"no-print mt-24 border-t border-line bg-surface/60\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-12 sm:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2.5 text-ink\",\"aria-label\":\"SEO Audit Analyzer home\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"viewBox\":\"0 0 64 64\",\"className\":\"h-8 w-8 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-[-6deg] group-hover:scale-105\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"defs\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"linearGradient\",null,{\"id\":\"audit-mark\",\"x1\":